The option is `cookiePrefix`, set in the `advanced` object of the auth options. The default prefix is "better-auth", so cookies follow the format `${prefix}.${cookie_name}`.

```ts
export const auth = betterAuth({
    advanced: {
        cookiePrefix: "my-app"
    }
})
```

Source: [Better Auth docs – Cookies](https://better-auth.com/docs/concepts/cookies)

